    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-38" id="fn-38" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The provisions of Codification Topic 980, "Regulated Operation," (Unamortized AFUDC in Plant) authorized in the FERC's Accounting Guidance issued April 23, 1993 in Docket No. AI93-5-000 - Accounting for Income Taxes. Regulatory asset additions for Topic 980 are based on balances in Construction Work in Progress (Account 107). The period of amortization for the Equity AFUDC regulatory asset balances correlates to depreciation rates of the property, plant and equipment of 2.86%.</link:footnote>
