    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-41" id="fn-41" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents under collections pursuant to the Ruby tariff fuel/power tracker mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-42" id="fn-42" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents unused carbon credits.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-43" id="fn-43" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Recorded pursuant to Docket No. AI93-5-000 issued April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-44" id="fn-44" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to the Ruby tariff fuel/power tracker mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-45" id="fn-45" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to the Ruby tariff fuel/power tracker mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-46" id="fn-46" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for transmission): 0 dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-47" id="fn-47" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for transmission):4,033 dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-48" id="fn-48" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for transmission): 12,614 dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-49" id="fn-49" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Park and loan service volumes reported net: 178,209 dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-50" id="fn-50" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Park and loan service volumes reported net: 1,000 dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-51" id="fn-51" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Park and loan service volumes reported net: (1,500) dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-52" id="fn-52" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Many of the natural gas volumes required to be reported on this page are tracked at the entity level, rather than by service type (i.e. firm transport, interruptible transport, etc.) or by discounted, negotiated, or recourse rate contracts and, therefore, the amounts reported have been allocated to the service types and to discounted, negotiated or recourse rate contracts based on reasonable assumptions.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-53" id="fn-53" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The cost rate percentage of common equity is based on Ruby's original certificate under Docket No. CP09-54.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-54" id="fn-54" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP is the source entity for the capital structure.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-55" id="fn-55" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Linepak move to inventory</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-56" id="fn-56" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fixed asset method is used for gas stored (lines 1 through 6).</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-57" id="fn-57" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The electric power cost used in compressor station operations was $5,205,832.24</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-58" id="fn-58" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Information provided represents general ledger dollar amounts and production month volumes.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-59" id="fn-59" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are based on direct distribution of labor charges from Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-60" id="fn-60" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for direct distribution of insurance costs from Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-61" id="fn-61" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for direct vehicle costs, for which Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC is reimbursed at cost.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-62" id="fn-62" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged by Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC through shared services are allocated using the Modified Massachusetts Model.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-63" id="fn-63" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for cell phone costs, for which Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC is reimbursed at cost.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-64" id="fn-64" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for firm transportation costs, net of fuel and power.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-65" id="fn-65" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Single-day peak deliveries was 10/16/2025</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-66" id="fn-66" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Three-day peak deliveries began 10/15/2025</link:footnote>
